OL,3,GNEWSACalls for new laws on illegal
OL,4,Atravellers' sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are growing calls from MPs for
OL,7,Fnew laws to deal with unauthorised
OL,8,Ftravellers' sites.
OL,10,FHigh-profile incidents took place on
OL,11,Ftwo sites in Hertfordshire earlier this
OL,12,Fyear, where groups of travellers
OL,13,Fstarted laying hardcore and building
OL,14,Ffences with no planning permission.
OL,16,FMPs are calling for the police to be
OL,17,Fgiven immediate powers of arrest and
OL,18,Fasset seizure, as well as restrictions
OL,19,Fon getting retrospective planning
OL,20,Fpermission.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
